python3-tensorflow for Debian
================================

Repackages the official PyPI wheel for tensorflow 2.21.0 (CPU build),
matching the build environment's Python version. ~570MB installed.

Requires the 'backports' Aptly component enabled for python3-protobuf
(>= 6.31), since Debian's archive python3-protobuf (3.21.x) cannot
satisfy TensorFlow's requirement.

Packaged for the invokeai-mastodon project's local NSFW image
classification (via opennsfw2's tf-keras backend).

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Sun, 06 Sep 2026 14:45:54 +0200
